    MC "여기서 뭘 어슬렁거리고 있는 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:312
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockClothesStore_056fedf8:

    # MC "If memory serves, this place is where all the top ladies go to get some... exquisite garments."
    MC "내 기억이 맞다면, 이곳은 모든 상류층 숙녀분들이... 정교한 의상을 사러 오는 곳이지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:313
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockClothesStore_4bbd5a66:

    # MC "Not that I needed something like that at the moment."
    MC "지금 당장 그런 게 필요한 건 아니지만."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:317
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockClothesStore_2_2e7bef50:

