    MC "이상하네, 가게가 급하게 잠긴 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:318
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockClothesStore_2_52ddd3cb:

