    # "{i}I won't go into further details here, the only thing I will say is, {b}fuck elves.{/b}{/i}"
    "{i}여기서 더 자세히 말하진 않겠어, 딱 하나만 말하자면, {b}엘프는 엿이나 먹으라 그래.{/b}{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:323
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockClothesStore_2_fa7b7aba:

