    # MC "Any trouble the state can't handle can be turned into a 'quest' for the guild to present as a contract."
    MC "국가가 처리할 수 없는 어떤 문제든 길드가 계약으로 제시할 '의뢰'로 바뀔 수 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:342
translate kr qst_Terminus_GuildBoard_308e9108:

