    # MC "*Sigh* time to head home for today."
    MC "*한숨* 오늘은 집에 갈 시간이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:356
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockBordelloInterior_17b6376a:

    # MC "I've had enough 'fun' today..."
    MC "오늘은 '즐길' 만큼 즐겼어..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:357
translate kr qst_Terminus_PathBlockBordelloInterior_ecb58a18:

    # MC "Gotta head home now."
    MC "이제 집에 가야 해."

